A44. Harass. ~ BESET
A46. What lovers cannot do when darkness comes. ~ SEE
A47. A runaway. ~ DESERTER
A49. Neither's pal. ~ NOR
A51. This makes regular trips to the West (abbr.). ~ RR
A52. There is no sense to this. ~ FOOL
A53. These make their way into the sea. ~ CAPES
A55. Harmonize. ~ ATTUNE
A58. The kind of night that keeps a girl at home. ~ DATELESS
A61. You'll find this in any well-stocked cellar (pl.) ~ COALS
