D21. What you'll get if you poke your nose into things. ~ ODOR
D22. This is the cause of much uneasiness. ~ RUB
D24. He-men. ~ MALES
D25. What you did when you took a chance. ~ DARED
D26. An idle buzzard. ~ DRONE
D28. This comes with the Spring. ~ FEVER
